      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poaGJuTm5hV0Z2TjNJNGRubE9UMUJHVTI5RGIyYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442aea3332376e5:0xb29cabf3c2baeba3"
